{
  "_comment": [
    "Live column manifest for public schema tables, captured from the database.",
    "",
    "This exists because of one specific bug class: a column was renamed when a",
    "migration was applied, the .sql file was never updated, and weeks later the file",
    "said 'timestamp' while the database had 'timestamp_value'. The first attempted",
    "fix would have added an empty duplicate column.",
    "",
    "SCHEMA-DRIFT-CHECK.mjs compares this against what the adapters map and what the",
    "migration files declare. Regenerate with the query in that script's header after",
    "any migration, and commit the change alongside it - a diff here is the point."
  ],
